      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20326665043830872
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "She further submits that though at the time of filing of the application medical documents have not been placed on record, however, a copy of the same has been received which will be placed on record as well as furnished to the learned APP/I.O.\n3.",
